  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Building resilience to Climate extremes (Int Climate Fund) Rapid Response Funding is a component of Providing Humanitarian Assistance in Sahel Emergencies (PHASE) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;1,499,999. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
